{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph"]]},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"Connectivity"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Connectivity\/StronglyConnectedComponents.swift#L148","fileName":"StronglyConnectedComponents.swift"},"role":"symbol","title":"stronglyConnectedComponents()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"stronglyConnectedComponents"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Components","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P12ConnectivityE27stronglyConnectedComponentsAD0G0VyxGyF"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"stronglyConnectedComponents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/Components","text":"Components","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Components are in the order Tarjan’s algorithm completes them, on a depth-first search"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with roots in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order and successors in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"successors(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":" order. That is a reverse"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"topological order of the condensation: every edge between components goes from a later"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"component to an earlier one, so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reversed()"},{"type":"text","text":" lists the components with every edge going"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"forward. Each component lists its vertices in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each component’s first vertex is its earliest in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":", so on a graph whose vertex"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"positions are insertion order ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"StableDirectedGraph"},{"type":"text","text":"), one sort by that vertex’s position"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"puts the components in insertion order, O(C log C) for C components:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let inInsertionOrder = graph.stronglyConnectedComponents()","    .sorted { graph.vertexPosition(of: $0.first!) < graph.vertexPosition(of: $1.first!) }"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"On any graph, one pass over ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"text":" lists them in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"text":" order, O(V):","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let components = graph.stronglyConnectedComponents()","let inVertexOrder = graph.vertices.compactMap { vertex in","    let component = components[components.component(of: vertex)]","    return component.first == vertex ? component : nil","}"]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(V + E).","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Complexity"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/stronglyConnectedComponents()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The strongly connected components: maximal sets of vertices each reaching every other, by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Tarjan’s algorithm."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/stronglyconnectedcomponents()"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/GraphProtocols/DirectedGraph/stronglyConnectedComponents()":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The strongly connected components: maximal sets of vertices each reaching every other, by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Tarjan’s algorithm."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"stronglyConnectedComponents"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Components","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/stronglyConnectedComponents()","url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/stronglyconnectedcomponents()","type":"topic","title":"stronglyConnectedComponents()"},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/GraphProtocols":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols","abstract":[],"role":"collection","type":"topic","title":"GraphProtocols","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols"},"doc://Connectivity/documentati